    "detailed_description": "<h1>A CINEMATIC SPACE SHOOTER - WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Fortress Building Puzzle is a puzzle game where you need to remove all the cubes to bring your castle to the ground, which is quite high.<br><br>You can choose the degree of difficulty from 1 to 7 floors of cubes.<br><br>Game Features: <br>- Unlimited time to bring the castle to the ground, so at difficult levels you can stay for hours<br>- All levels have a solution, and everything here is based on physics<br>- Choose the degree of dificulty you want<br>- Direct your view to the tower with the help of arrows from the keyboard or those from the screen",
